title: '[[id:67f2e38a-1099-4357-a521-f2ca38b3a3ca][? Containing an overrider should count as integrating the original it stands for. Not built.]]'
pid: 1177bfc8-64ef-44c1-a6f9-396ab425a990
body: |2-
  Open it when Jeff answers whether a message his note holds a reply to
  should stop showing as new, or before changing what counts as
  unintegrated: it holds that question, what I would build, what it
  costs and what it breaks.
